WEBVTT

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.730
W-We transported...

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.480
Along with Lord Anos!

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.690
Wait a second,
you think this was an indirect transfer?

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.610
What is it,
like an indirect kiss?

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.410
If we got transferred by linking spaces...

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:20.620
Then it's the same
as if we all got linked to Lord Anos!

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:21.700
Oh!

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.500
And since it was our first time ever...

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:28.630
First indirect transfer!

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.050
Settle down, my students.

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:32.970
A god's word is absolute.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:34.380
Whoops, uh-oh...

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.800
He called us out...

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:40.260
Starting today, we'll be administering
an Aharthern Expedition Exam.

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:42.640
That forest is a Spirit.

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.900
The way to it depends on
the rumors of the time.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:52.230
You will search for those rumors,
and reach the forest within ten days.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:56.070
That will be your task for this expedition exam.

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.370
When the Lishas Meadows surrounding Zehenburg
are covered in a mysterious fog,

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.160
you'll find mischievous spirits lurking there.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:05.040
Make them smile,
and they'll show you the way.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.960
This rumor is your clue.

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:11.340
Now, then, offer the gods your gratitude
and highest praise,

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:12.760
and let the exam begin!

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:16.630
I know it's an order, but still...

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:19.970
I just can't figure these Gods out.

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:55.110
03 - THE SPIRIT'S SCHOOL BUILDING

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:55.400
Well, we split up into four groups,
but since we're with you, Anos...

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:58.610
Does that mean it's possible that one
of us is the Child of God?

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:00.240
The odds are about the same.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:04.240
Misha did create a pseudo-god,
but she is a descendant of mine.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:07.830
Who do you think you are, little girl?

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:09.710
Ugh!

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:11.920
You may be an information broker or whatever,

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:14.540
but you better stop spreading vile reviews
of my shop!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:16.000
You only have yourself to blame!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.800
Running your business like a scam,
and ripping off travelers the way you do!

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:21.050
Who's running the scam here?

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:25.140
I've heard how you're always talking up
a storm about a forest that doesn't exist!

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:29.270
Aharthern does too exist!
You just don't believe it!

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:30.310
Tch!

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:33.060
Hey, give this one a beatdown!

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.280
I'd stop right there if I were you.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.940
Who the hell are you?

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:41.400
Butt out, stranger!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.740
Sorry, but I need to speak with this woman.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:47.330
What a pain in the butt!
Go on, school him about local customs!

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:54.420
Forgive me, I couldn't help blasting
you away with my laugh.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:04:00.460
If safety is important to you,
I wouldn't say anything too funny.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:04.430
Thanks. I owe you one!

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:07.010
That's all right.
I wanted to ask you something.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:09.600
Do you know the way to Aharthern?

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:11.980
Then you believe it exists?

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:13.310
I've been there before.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:14.310
Huh?

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:18.520
But to enter that forest,
one needs to know about its rumors.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:22.860
If you agree to tell me what they are,
I'll give you whatever you want.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:26.370
Then will you bring me along?

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:29.240
That would be fine.
But what do you want to do there?

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.500
I don't know.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:36.170
I know this may sound strange...

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:39.340
But I've lost my memory, see.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.380
Hmm.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.300
When I came to,
I was here in this town.

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.930
And I know there was something
that I needed to do...

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:53.560
But when I heard the rumor about Aharthern,
I knew that I had to go there.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:58.400
I feel like I've forgotten something
that I shouldn't have.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:01.610
I'm sure I'll find a clue in Aharthern!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:03.820
<i>She doesn't seem to be a Demon.</i>

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.150
What are you going to do?

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.910
Fine. I'll take you with me.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.620
Really? Thanks!

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:15.580
I'm an information broker,
and I've gathered all kinds of rumors about Aharthern.

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.290
Was there a rumor about a mysterious fog?

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:19.340
Yes.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:22.420
The fog covers
the meadows during an eclipse.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:26.090
An eclipse?
But those hardly ever happen, do they?

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:28.720
No, there'll be one nine days from now.

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:29.640
What?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.470
About three minutes past noon.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:32.560
Three minutes...

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:36.310
Not a lot of time to make the spirits smile.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.310
Misha.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:39.480
Let Lay and the others know.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:40.440
Let's go.

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:42.900
Go? What about the eclipse?

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:44.780
Not a problem.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:47.450
Ih Guneas.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:00.790
Even moving a star isn't beyond me.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:05.420
Oh! The fog is rising!

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.680
Aharthern must be beyond that!

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.510
Anos' magic doesn't seem to surprise you.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:11.220
What?

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.350
I guess not.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.930
But somehow it feels familiar.

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.270
Do you remember your own name?

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:21.690
It's Lena. I think...

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:26.030
All right, Lena. Do you know any rumors about
the spirits luring in that fog?

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:31.070
The Spirits, Tithi.
Since they love anything new,

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:34.120
you can probably get them to smile
if you show them something cutting-edge.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:37.200
Cutting-edge might be easier said than done.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.460
I have a plan.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:39.500
What kind?

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.710
I'll say something funny.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.460
And then you'll correct me, Sasha.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:44.710
And then?

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.170
They'll burst out laughing.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.720
I've never heard
of such a half-baked plan!

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:49.510
You don't like it?

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.340
Of course not.

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.890
Everybody!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:56.140
There was an eclipse all of a sudden,
and it gave us a start!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:07:01.520
If there's fog already,
does that mean we can get to Aharthern now?

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:06.150
We've only just begun.
All of you, use your hidden abilities.

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:14.780
Tithi, here's the question!

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:17.620
What are my favorite numbers?

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:19.620
Zero and three, I think?

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.960
Lay...

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:25.170
Who said to start mooning over each other?

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.050
Now then, Zeshia.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.010
Let's see your Sasha impression!

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:31.970
Lord Demon King... I love you.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.340
That's ridiculous!

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.050
And now your Misha impression!

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.930
Misha's gonna do her best.

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:39.310
Who's that?

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.190
I don't sound like her?

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:47.690
I mean, why are you teaching Zeshia
to mimic people anyway?

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:49.320
Hmm.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.900
Lord Anos!

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:52.740
We're so sorry!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:54.990
For being late!

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.120
Where did you get those?

00:07:57.330 --> 00:08:01.960
Oh, we bought them
in that town just now.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:05.290
S-See, they had such a lucky name,
we couldn't help ourselves.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.420
Oh? What would that name be?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:12.300
It's... the Club of Anossu, see.

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:18.260
How can you utter the name "Club of Anossu"
in front of Lord Anos, Ellen?

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:21.770
You need to be more careful.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.520
R-Right.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:28.520
It's the real thing!

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:32.110
The real thing!
The real thing!

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:35.610
Real thing?

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.700
The Club of Anossu.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.620
Lord Anos's...

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:44.210
...Club of Anossu.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.080
What interesting children!

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.790
What fun children!

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.920
Long time no see, Tithi.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.050
Huh?

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.010
What's this?

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.430
I know this person!

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:57.180
It's the Demon King of Tyranny.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:00.810
I'd like to go to Aharthern.
Will you show me the way?

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:01.560
Sure!

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:02.770
Sure! Come on!

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.060
To the Great Spirit Forest!

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:09.480
You might as well see it up close.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:12.570
That way, I can keep an eye on you better.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:16.610
No need to be so wary.
I'm only going to lead the class.

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:19.410
Since it's an order.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.660
We're here!
The Great Spirit Forest!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.000
So this is Aharthern.

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:34.220
Tithi. There should be a Demon here
named Shin Reglia. Do you know him?

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:35.970
Shin Reglia?

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.260
Don't know him!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:38.640
Don't know him, do we?

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:40.760
There are subordinates of the Demon King.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:43.060
Demons from 2,000 years ago.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:45.100
They're in the Spirit's School Building.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:48.810
Anos, Spirit?

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.270
Apparently so.

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:53.400
A Spirit based on a rumor about memories...

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:54.820
That's what it might mean.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:56.530
- Hey!
- Huh?

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.240
This girl looks like Leno!

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.580
She really does!

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.160
Great Spirit Leno!

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.000
Huh?

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:07.330
The mother of all Spirits.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:09.000
But Leno is...

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.460
She passed away.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:12.920
When was it?

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.420
Hmm, when was it?

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:15.840
A few years ago?

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:17.260
Maybe 2,000 years ago?

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:19.470
I forget!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:26.230
<i>Because she is the child borne by
the Great Spirit Leno.</i>

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:31.940
What? What?

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:33.900
But she smells like her.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:36.780
Leno's smell.

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:40.820
Uh... I was told that I'm
the Great Spirit Leno's child by birth.

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:43.240
Child by birth?
The child in her tummy?

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:44.910
What's your name?

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.250
Misa.

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.870
You're Misa?

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.080
Hmm.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:53.380
Um! Then do you know who the father is?

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.800
Of Leno's child?

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.130
That's a secret!

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:01.010
We're not allowed to tell!

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:03.350
The Spirit King said so!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.100
Spirit King?

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.390
He didn't exist 2,000 years ago.

00:11:13.110 --> 00:11:15.570
Wow, it's gigantic!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.480
What a shock.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.240
Here he is!

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:22.030
Some Demons are here.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:23.450
Always here.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.410
A classroom?

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:27.160
But nobody's here.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:28.080
What?

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.330
What's this?

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.040
They've been spirited away!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.630
Well, well.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:36.630
Who would've thought I'd see you here?

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.760
You haven't changed.
After going after my subordinates...

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:44.140
...you have some nerve,
Scarlet Monument King Gilysiris.

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:45.220
Scarlet Monument King!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.890
Ah, ah. You mean Zabro?

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.980
Even I didn't intend for that to happen, you know.

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.860
But there's so much pressure from above.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.440
I never thought you'd serve another Demon.

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:05.990
It's been 2,000 years. You shouldn't judge things
by outdated, shallow criteria.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:10.000
I have surpassed you by far.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:13.580
I wonder if any of the other Four Evil Royals
are around, too?

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:14.880
The bad kids?

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.500
They'll be here soon!

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.550
The one with the horns,
and the one with the eye patch!

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:27.140
Unless the necessary sacrifices are made,

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.770
there will only be more additional sacrifices.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:30.890
King of the Netherworld.

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:34.400
When did you ally yourself with
the Scarlet Monument King and the King of Curses?

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:38.230
If that's how it looks to you,
it's the Spirits' handiwork.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:43.780
School bell?
Enyunien?

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:48.830
What's going on here?

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:50.240
Are we trapped in here?

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:53.000
My name is Enyunien.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:00.460
This is the Spirit's School Building.

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.800
Why's everyone just sitting here quietly?

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:12.180
Hmm... we might all be trapped inside this place.

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:14.980
Let me explain to the new students.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:20.520
In this building, we teach about various Spirits,
and their histories.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.360
To enter means that you've matriculated,

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.910
and you cannot leave until you've graduated.

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:30.410
As the so-called Great Tree Spirit of Education,
I'll be teaching this class.

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:35.160
Those who fail will be spirited away,
thanks to the Hidden Wolf Gennul.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:39.290
Also, we have a zero-tolerance policy
regarding violence here.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:44.670
Anyone who defies this policy will be forced
to traverse the back of the long serpent Ibiteoh.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.590
What do we have to do in order to graduate?

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:48.970
You must pass my trials.

00:13:49.350 --> 00:13:53.310
Those who take three tests,
and get an average score of more than 80,

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.810
are eligible to undergo the Spirit's Trial.

00:13:55.940 --> 00:14:01.360
Pass that, and you will be granted
an audience with the Spirit King.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:04.740
And those who succeed can then graduate.

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:06.650
And those who've been spirited away?

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:11.490
If you plead your case to the Spirit King,
I believe he'll return them to you.

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:14.830
In other words, our only option
is to go through these trials.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:16.660
I understand how it works now.

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.620
But let us take one single test.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:20.460
What's that now?

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.420
We can just take the three tests in one go.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:27.170
Hmm. Right,
but my tests are difficult, you know.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:28.430
It's fine.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.600
Very well. However...

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:36.310
To pass,
you must score at least 90.

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:42.230
Quite a bold thing to do.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.820
The tests will be held a week from now.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:47.360
Don't think that they'll be easy.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.610
Then why don't we bet on it,
Scarlet Monument King?

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:50.570
Bet, did you say?

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.780
We will all pass these tests.

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:56.250
Not just you, you mean?

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:57.330
Yes.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:15:02.670
If I win, then you'll have to tell me about
the "one above" from whom you received your orders.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:07.340
Then if I win,
I shall claim your Source.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:08.420
It's settled, then.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:11.340
You'll soon regret this.
Zecht.

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:12.340
Zecht.

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:18.600
Do we have a chance of winning?

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.690
These are Spirit tests we're talking about, right?

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:23.360
I think they'll be hard.

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:25.320
You can start learning now.

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.030
And there's someone here who's well-informed.

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:28.780
What? Me?

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:33.120
Lena. Do you know that you're a Spirit?

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:34.490
Yes.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:39.580
I got a vague sense of that when we got here...
and now I'm certain.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.420
You spoke his name before Enyunien even arrived.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:45.710
I don't believe that that was due to hearsay.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:49.630
Well, I remembered that all of a sudden.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:55.050
It seemed like I knew about
the Spirit's School building... and Gennul, too.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:56.220
Hmm.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:16:00.600
If you can find the trigger,
you may find a way to restore your memories.

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.690
Empty out your mind.

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:04.520
Okay.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:10.280
Well?

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:15.030
I remember now... I think.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:18.160
A lot of things about the Spirits.

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:21.710
I... have to see the Spirit King.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.120
Why is that?

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.630
I can't remember.

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:26.790
That's all I know about myself.

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:31.090
Are there things that people can't remember,
even under your spells, Lord Anos?

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:34.300
Well, this might not be just your ordinary amnesia.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:38.140
But there are other ways
of recovering those memories.

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:39.890
Thank you!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.430
You really are amazing, after all, Anos.

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:43.810
What do you mean, after all?

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:47.440
Huh? Um... I don't know,
that's just how it feels.

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.650
I might have met you before, maybe?

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.450
Is that right?

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:57.160
All right, let's start
with a study group for the test, everyone.

00:16:57.160 --> 00:17:00.620
Yeah, but we don't even know what
the range of the test will be.

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.960
Don't worry, I know!

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:05.540
This is the Forest of Books!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:08.340
The green books are all about the Spirits,

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:10.460
and the test questions will come from here.

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:13.170
Wow! That's a boatload of books!

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:15.800
Reading... isn't my strong point.

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.100
Hmm...

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.650
Huh? You're done reading already?

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.860
I only got through half.

00:17:30.860 --> 00:17:31.730
Huh?

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:35.150
If you can't pull this off overnight,
you won't escape death.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.820
That was 2,000 years ago, though, right?

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:40.740
Leave the studying methods to me.

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:43.830
I'll turn you all into fine Spirit Scholars.

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:06.100
I can't find anything that would tell us
about you in these books.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:07.650
I see.

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:10.110
But there is just one page that caught my eye.

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:13.360
Love Fairy Fran?

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:16.490
The Spirit who gives shape
to unrequited love,

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.410
and brings people together...

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:20.370
The page has been ripped out.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:21.450
Right.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:22.120
Rivide.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:27.790
Seems to have been torn out quite
a long time ago.

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:35.510
The test questions can be found
in the Book Fairy Leelan.

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:38.470
The time limit is one hour.

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.260
Begin!

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:45.520
<i>Although definitely a Spirit,</i>

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:49.060
<i>which Spirit isn't based on any rumors?</i>

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:52.480
<i>The answer is Hexapod Fairy Jijayk.</i>

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:57.280
<i>Love is memory. Memory is love...</i>

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:59.950
<i>The spirit who wanders about seeking love...</i>

00:19:00.780 --> 00:19:03.490
<i>Nothing about this Spirit has been recorded
in the Forest of Books.</i>

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.040
<i>So the answer's on that page?</i>

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.460
<i>Love Fairy Fran.</i>

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:16.380
<i>Strange. It should be easy
to answer questions of this level.</i>

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:20.380
<i>Meaning that those are the wrong questions?</i>

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:22.720
<i>Would you like to check yourself, Demon King?</i>

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:26.720
<i>If you can get past the Demonic Eyes
of Enyunien, who can see all foul play,</i>

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:29.850
<i>and look at the answers written
by your subordinates.</i>

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:34.520
<i>Although those Demonic Eyes have
been bolstered by this stone monument.</i>

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:36.480
<i>Hmm.</i>

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:40.360
<i>Your defeat has already been determined.</i>

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:43.450
<i>I see... So you've tampered with the questions.</i>

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:45.990
<i>Show me some proof.</i>

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:49.160
<i>But if you look at anyone else's answers,
you'll be cheating.</i>

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:52.670
<i>That would depend on the time and place.</i>

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.210
Although definitely a Spirit,

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.760
which Spirit isn't based on any rumors?

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:02.220
<i>Well, that's too bad.
The questions are the same.</i>

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:05.180
Enyunien! I caught this one cheating!

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:07.010
You must fail him on the spot!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:08.970
That, I cannot do.

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.600
What are you talking about?

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:13.980
Do you cheat after the test is over?

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:14.940
Huh?

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:18.940
I've already received Anos's answers.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:19.990
What?

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:22.530
I never even saw him writing.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:24.160
You didn't see me?

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:28.950
Oh, but Anos. Make sure you don't disturb
the other students.

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:29.700
Right.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:43.340
<i>I wanted to save this for later, but...</i>

00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:02.280
Mmm... Now then,
shall I announce the results?

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:05.660
Eges Code, 85

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:08.780
Kyhilam Jiste, 81.

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:11.540
Gilysiris Dello, 80.

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:15.670
Next, the new students.
Zeshia Bianca...

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:19.380
150 points out of a perfect score of 100!

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:20.710
Impossible!

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:26.720
And as for the other new students,
everyone got a perfect score of 100!

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:29.680
Now this can't possibly be right.

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:32.180
There must've been some kind of foul play.

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:36.940
I had my eyes peeled.
There was absolutely no foul play here.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:39.440
Would you mind showing me the answers?

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.520
Fine.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:47.700
Question 27,
the correct answer is Corpse of Lava...

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:50.160
But "Daytoylich" has been entered here.

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:52.240
The scoring must be off, no?

00:21:52.410 --> 00:21:56.920
Hmm. But I felt that it could also
be interpreted that way.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:58.080
What?

00:21:58.080 --> 00:22:02.130
This one, too! Question 15,
the number of Spirits related to fishing.

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:03.840
The answer is 17!

00:22:03.840 --> 00:22:08.800
Depending on how you count them,
I thought that 21 could be possible, too.

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:11.640
Then what about this?

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:13.220
It says, "I don't know"!

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:14.560
No matter how you look at it,

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:16.480
it can't be right!

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:19.360
To admit honestly that one doesn't know—

00:22:19.360 --> 00:22:21.820
not everyone can do such a thing.

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:25.240
What—no way—this is...

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:27.990
Did you think that just because
the answers were wrong,

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:30.280
we couldn't get a perfect score?

00:22:33.910 --> 00:22:35.500
Before the Magic Sword of Destruction,

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:38.290
even a blank page becomes a score of 100.

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:40.330
What a dirty trick.

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:43.750
Now, then, who's the dirty one here?

00:22:44.550 --> 00:22:45.670
Rivide.

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:50.550
The questions were rewritten,
only during the actual test.

00:22:50.550 --> 00:22:53.220
You must've spoken directly to the Book Spirits,

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:55.720
and gone behind both mine and Enyunien's backs.

00:22:58.060 --> 00:23:00.310
To honor our contract,
you will now answer.

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:02.770
Is your "superior" the Spirit King?

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:06.280
That would be correct.

00:23:06.530 --> 00:23:09.820
Did you use his power to engage in foul play?

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:14.410
You have no proof that it was I.

00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:19.750
Mm... that's true.
As they say, innocent until proven guilty.

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:24.920
I'm going to grant everyone
the right to undergo the trial.

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.630
You've all passed!

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:39.980
THE SPIRIT'S TRIAL

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:38.230
The Spirit's Trial.
